'''Icepiercer''' is an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] gun that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 20th tier in the Battle Pass for 75,000 [[Snow Tokens]] {{Currency|Snow Token}} during the [[Christmas Event 2022|2022 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Icepiercer, like [[Harvester]], resembles a crossbow. The crossbow has an ice-themed design, with ice spikes protruding in various spots. Like its arrow, its shooting trail is light blue.  

== Trivia == 
*It is the seventh ancient weapon to be obtained by purchasing the final tier in an event, the others being [[Elderwood Scythe]], [[Logchopper]], [[Hallowscythe]], [[Icebreaker]], [[Harvester]], [[Gingerscope]], [[Traveler's Axe]] and [[Swirly Axe]].
*It is the second ancient gun to be released in the game, the first being [[Harvester]], and the third being [[Gingerscope]].
*It is the second gun in [[Murder Mystery 2]] to resemble a Crossbow, the first being Harvester.
*It is the second gun in Murder Mystery 2 to have a unique shooting sound effect and trail when used—others being [[Harvester]], [[Gingerscope]], [[Raygun]], [[Chroma Raygun]], [[Snowcannon]], and [[Chroma Snowcannon]].
*It partners with the ancient knife [[Icebreaker]] and the godly gun [[Iceblaster]], making the [https://supremevalues.com/mm2/sets.html Full Ice Set]
**It also partners with the [[Evo Weapons|Evo]] knife [[Icecrusher]], however, it is not apart of the Full Ice Set.
*There are [[Red Icepiercer|red]], [[Bronze Icepiercer|bronze]], [[Silver Icepiercer|silver]], and [[Gold Icepiercer|gold]] reskin variants of this gun, which were awarded as [[Unique Weapons|unique]] trophies for placing in the top 100 during the [[Christmas Event 2022|2022 Christmas Event]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*There was a bug that lasted for two days where this gun appeared as a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] instead of an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]]. However, this issue was soon resolved on December 23rd, 2022.

